<title>UK: World Bank sets 150 bln lire five-year bond.</title>
<headline>World Bank sets 150 bln lire five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Credito Italiano (books) and Citibank.  BORROWER   WORLD BANK</p>
<p> AMT    150 BLN LIRE  COUPON     7.45	MATURITY  * 20.MAY.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.52    PAY DATE    20.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.75	REOFFER    99.95     SPREAD	=</p>
<p> NOTES    * CALL AT PAR ON 20.MAY.98</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 5-50	SALE LIMITS US/UK/IT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.50	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF GLOBAL MULTI-CURRENCY PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
